WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.610 --> 00:01:37.240
I'm Kurata Sana, first year Middle
School student.

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:42.580
Same Name Appears!

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:48.670
I'm Kurata Sana, actress, first year junior high student, pleased to meet you.

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:52.500
You are probably surprised to
suddenly receive my letter.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:55.130
Having the same name is not only a coincidence...

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:57.630
I'm the real Kurata Sana...

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:00.050
Ah! What is saying?

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:02.260
The real Sana is right here.

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:04.600
Sana-chan, what are you saying?

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:10.440
Movies and the Broadway show were successful because of my hard work.

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:13.860
Not yours. In other words,
you're nothing but a fake.

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:16.490
Whoa! What's going on here?

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:18.030
You're not thinking clearly
either...

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:20.320
But this handwriting
looks very similar to yours.

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:22.700
No, it doesn't.
I never draw hearts.

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:26.500
And I would never try to act like
a goody goody, using formal words.

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:28.790
Anyway, it's definitely not my
writing.

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:32.500
Right, a good kid wouldn't put her
feet on the table while wearing slippers.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.250
Anyway, I'm the real Kurata Sana.
This person is the Fake!

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:36.340
I know.

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:39.430
But this letter says...
Anyway, I'm the real Kurata Sana.

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:41.090
We'll see when the time comes, bye.

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:43.600
So we'll see when the time comes...

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:45.520
Shimura-san, telephone!

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:47.390
Sagami-san, it's the director Ono.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:49.140
For me? Who could it be?

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:51.480
Hello?

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:54.400
- I'm the director Ono.
- Wow! Director Ono!

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:59.070
I said that I hated him before... I need to apologize now.

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:01.110
Director Ono,
I was just kidding earlier.

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:03.530
Actually, I really like you a lot.

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:06.830
But you said clearly
that you hated me.

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:09.040
I still remember that.

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:12.170
But today I'm talking about
something else.

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:14.590
I received Sana-chan's fax.

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:15.710
Fax?

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:19.630
She wrote, "How are you, director?
I heard you are working on a new movie."

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:23.510
"I'll be very glad even if there's
only a small role available."

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:25.260
This is what the fax said.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:30.850
Right now I'm in Africa directing a crazy wild animal documentary.

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:33.230
Of course risking my life
in the process.

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:36.480
To tell you the truth,
about Sana-chan...

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.820
...she won't work out.

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:42.240
That guy doesn't value life.

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:43.910
Please survive.

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:45.660
What? What? What happened?

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:48.240
Sana-chan,
did you fax the director Ono?

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:50.200
Director Ono is...

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:53.370
I'm director Ono,
I'm risking my life.

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:54.880
I didn't fax him.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:57.550
Sana-chan,
your cell phone is ringing.

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:59.670
Ah, thanks, Shimura-san.

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:03.680
Yes? I'm Kurata Sana... even though
I don't want to, I'm turning 13 soon.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:04.680
Who is it?

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:08.060
Hiroshi... Uchiyamada...?

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:12.020
Uchiyamada, you're the one from
Child's Toy?

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:13.560
How are you? Long time no see.

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:17.610
Great, I'm feeling great.
Thanks, Sana-chan.

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:20.860
Right now, I'm at a noodle eating
competition.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:23.070
I wanted to thank you
for the huge bouquet.

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:27.330
I will try best. I will eat as
much ramen as I can.

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:30.410
What bouquet?

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:32.870
Oh, it's starting.
Bye, Sana-chan!

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:34.420
Bye.

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.290
What?

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:39.000
I'm still alive.

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:41.760
Something's strange.

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:45.510
Makes me uncomfortable.
It's like there's another me around.

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:48.010
It's this.

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:49.930
The other Kurata Sana?

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:52.060
The one who called me a fake.

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:54.020
There's really a fake one!

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:56.900
What's wrong, Rei-kun?

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:58.560
Let me take off the sunglasses.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:00.940
Why do you look uncertain?

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.990
You are the real one, right?

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:07.410
Yeah, so lucky. I heard Sana-chan's going to France for a movie shoot.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:10.580
I wanted to go once.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:13.750
If I could go to a hot springs
for a shoot, I'd be very... satisfied.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:15.830
France?

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:18.130
Sana-chan, I heard you're coming
out with a new record?

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:19.840
It's the CD age, mister.

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:21.300
It's a CD, right, Sana-chan?

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:23.710
What are you two talking about?

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:26.220
When's it going to be out?
I'll definitely buy it.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:27.430
I'll support you too.

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:30.050
I'm sure it'll be better than
that famous singer Miyaka-san.

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:31.140
Um... okay.

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:33.720
Even stranger now.

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:36.440
Sana-chan, I heard you're going be
in a TV drama?

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:38.440
And you're going to be the main
character?

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:42.020
We were still serried about that
other time when the media blacklisted you.

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:44.030
So you are jumping back into
show biz?

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:46.570
And you'll make a photo book too, right, Sana-chan?

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:49.910
And you're going to advertise for
the fire department one day.

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:52.490
Umm...
May I ask who told you all this?

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.330
Who?

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:55.870
Everyone's saying it.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:58.960
Right, everyone's saying it.
And it's spreading around.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:02.040
Everyone? Who is it?
What are their names?

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:04.300
When did they tell you? Where?

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:08.220
At what hour, minute, second?
Don't listen to rumors.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:11.010
What does this guy want?

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:13.760
What's wrong?
You're so cranky in the morning.

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:15.310
Yo. Fuka-chan.

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:18.640
Listen, last night on the radio
your ad was hilarious.

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:20.980
On the radio?

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:24.070
What did I do?

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:25.780
You sent them a postcard.

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:28.110
"I'm Kurata Sana, 12 years old.

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:30.160
Even though I don't want to, I'm
going to turn 13 very soon."

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:31.070
I didn't do it.

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:33.530
Stop lying!
The important part is in the end.

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:34.700
What else is there?

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:36.410
You said your mom's job isn't
going so well.

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:38.540
You want to run away from home by
jumping out the window.

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:41.920
And you talked about going to the
temple for prayers is the New Year.

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:44.300
Wow, they know about going to the
temple for prayer too?

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:48.260
A lot of things that only Sana-chan knows herself, but nobody else does.

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:50.720
What's with the weird expression?

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:53.300
That wasn't me.

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:54.850
What is this?
I don't understand.

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:58.810
You received a letter from someone
claiming to be you?

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:02.100
The world contains another me.

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:05.730
I've heard of this before.
It's called person from the mirrors.

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:07.110
Person from walls?

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:08.490
No, person from mirrors.

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:10.950
In other words,
there's another person.

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:13.030
- You're saying I have a twin?
- That's not it.

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:14.950
It's a fantasy world.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:17.450
You're the real Sana, right?

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:18.960
I'm not sure...

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:21.210
- What's 7 times 7?
- 29.

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:24.340
- You're the real one.
- ???

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:26.590
If you're the real Sana then get
a grip.

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:31.550
Just hearing the rumors, one would
think the fake Sana is a lot better than you.

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:35.010
She goes on TV for promotions
every day, never a moment of rest.

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:38.270
And she's going everywhere in
the country, like the old you.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:40.390
The old me?

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:45.400
Look at you now. You can't do work, you can't even do the times tables.

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:47.360
Also, you're indecisive about relationships.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:50.110
You can't finish anything you
start. It's pitiful.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:53.030
You can't even compare to half of
the old Sana.

00:07:55.780 --> 00:08:00.330
Sana, please be strong. Life isn't
always a cruel winter.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.420
Ah, I shouldn't say such serious things.

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:08.590
Right right, Sana-chan is working
hard for the Math Teacher Tapes Vol. 2 and 3.

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:09.550
Time for a beating.

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:14.010
But Sana-chan's efforts have paid off.
Math Teacher's performance is pretty good.

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:18.140
The shooting of the tape is also
successful. Easy, easy.

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:21.060
All right, let's start shooting
Vol.3 today.

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:23.730
- Since it's not dark yet.
- Alright!

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:25.810
It's because we don't have
enough money.

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:28.400
Of course it's better to have
money, being broke is terrible.

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:30.150
Don't talk about bad things.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:30.150
White dolphin.

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.450
Congratulations.

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.780
Everyone, good work.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:38.450
All three Math Teacher videos are
finished.

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:41.660
We went overtime. They shut off
the heat, and there's nothing to eat.

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:45.170
I can only propose a toast to
celebrate. Sorry about that.

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:48.460
- It's because...
- We don't have enough money!

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:50.960
In all my 46 years
of being a cameraman,

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:54.430
there's not one time when the
budget was enough.

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:58.010
If we can finish before money runs
out this time, then it'll be first.

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:03.100
This time has been my happiest
experience.

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:06.520
This is all due to Sana-chan's help.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:08.310
Don't say it like that.

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:10.440
In the beginning
this humble job...

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:11.900
Ah, sorry.

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:15.610
I mean when you were in Water Palace and the huge Broadway musical,

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:17.780
you were so famous, Sana-chan.

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:21.620
I thought you wouldn't give the Math Teacher series any thought at all.

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:24.330
This wasn't a glamorous job.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:28.080
But instead you didn't complain.

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:31.250
And you found friends to help you
with math, your weak point,

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:33.800
and put in a lot of work to finish this series.

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:36.180
I don't deserve all of your
compliments.

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:38.640
No, I really do admire you.

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:43.770
The Kurata Sana from Water Palace and the Kurata Sana who couldn't say 'devil' in her lines.

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:46.640
Now the Kurata Sana that's in
the Math Teacher series...

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:49.940
All played by one Kurata Sana.

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:53.440
Three totally different characters played by the same person.

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:57.990
Sana-chan,
we'll see each other again.

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:00.530
Good-bye everyone.
I wish all of you well.

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:05.330
What's it?

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:09.880
Director finally admits I'm
Kurata Sana now.

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:13.380
Of course, because you are
Kurata Sana.

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:16.720
That means I'm the real one.

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:19.220
But before they said I was a fake.

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:22.600
I see, so you're still holding a
grudge against that letter.

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:25.310
Of course I'm still upset.
I'm the real one.

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:27.770
You even doubted yourself.

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:30.650
But it doesn't matter now.

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:33.770
Who cares if she is real or fake.

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:36.400
I'm me and
that's all that matters.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:40.870
I hope everything goes back to normal soon. Back to work on the Math Teacher...

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:46.950
This Math Teacher series is the
first time Sana-chan's felt happy from work.

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:49.330
It was a good choice to accept
the job.

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:53.250
Everyone, I'll see you next week.

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:55.340
This dude... has no shame.

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:57.460
White dolphin, white dolphin,
white dolphin.

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:14.060
Thanks, Rei-kun.

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:16.610
I'll park the car inside.

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:17.940
Hurry up.

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:19.490
Sana-chan.

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:21.410
Hey, Hayama-chan.

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:23.530
Training, huh? You're sweating.

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:24.450
Yeah.

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:27.410
What's wrong?
Not in a good mood?

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:33.380
I've always respected your work
and I've never had anything against it...

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:37.090
But... Cancel that concert.

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:39.670
It looks ugly.

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:41.470
I mean...

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:43.970
How do I say this?

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:45.890
I think it's embarrassing.

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:49.600
What are you talking about?

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:53.690
I'm talking about the outfit
for that concert.

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:55.650
Whose concert?

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:57.780
Kurata Sana-chan's, of course.

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:00.990
Hey, Sana-chan.

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:03.820
You should take a bath and get
some sleep soon.

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:08.790
Sana's concert

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:11.620
The fake.

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:22.590
{parte b}

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:24.090
Sana's concert

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:25.890
This one is a fake.

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:28.510
The real one is here.

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:30.270
How disgusting.

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:32.690
- So what should we do?
- ???

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:34.270
Call the police?

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:35.810
No, not the police.

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:38.270
We should
all go and take a look.

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:40.570
Let's go see the concert.

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:43.110
Sensei, this isn't funny.

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:45.360
Who said I was joking?

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:47.120
What theory it is?

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:50.290
My daughter's concert.
As a mother, I must go there.

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:56.540
I'm scared of him!

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:59.340
Sensei, please finish the draft
quickly.

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:02.260
He's here again?
I am in a low mood.

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:04.970
But I'm in a working mood.

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:08.010
Sensei, please hurry.

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:12.930
You can't possibly be in a
non-working mood right now.

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:15.140
Was that Onda-san?

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:19.020
Maybe... maybe not.

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:21.530
I'm the real one.

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:24.030
- Onda-san!
- Good evening.

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:26.360
- Then that was...
- My younger brother.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:28.120
He goes to a fitness club in his college.

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.330
Younger brother?

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:31.660
Yeah, he's helping me today.

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:35.040
So you're saying that that was
Onda-san's impostor?

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:37.880
Ah, it's not a big deal really.

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:42.210
If my brother graduates and becomes
an editor himself, he has more drive,

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:45.590
and he'll probably have a better position than me.

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:49.890
That fake Onda is probably better
than the real one.

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:53.470
Right now this sort of talk is not
pleasing to my ears.

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:56.640
Impostor is better
than the real thing.

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:57.730
White dolphin.

00:13:57.730 --> 00:14:00.150
I don't care about concert.

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:01.480
No, I'll go and take a look.

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:04.030
- But should you go alone?
- You'll go with me!

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:06.900
- But I'm busy...
- What are you talking about?

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:09.530
- Over there.
- Looks suspicious.

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:11.410
There are many people in line.

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:14.660
Let's wait until all of the
audience moves in.

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:17.160
Everyone's inside.
We should go too.

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:21.840
- I hear something.
- It's starting.

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:23.710
Sounds awfully like you.

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:26.260
My voice isn't that lively.

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:27.670
Really?

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:28.800
Let's go in, Rei-kun.

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:30.090
Wait a second.

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:33.680
You guys came too?

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:37.020
No, we organized this concert.

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:39.020
You guys?

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:41.560
You're an impostor.

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:45.320
We only want the real Sana-chan.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:46.990
So will you please leave.

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:49.200
What are you talking about?

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:51.660
The concert is starting,
we're going in.

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:53.780
Wait a second!
You guys are way off!

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:55.040
Wait a second. Hello?

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:57.160
You guys made mistake.

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:59.160
The real Sana is right here!

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:00.920
Rei-kun.

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:05.250
Don't mind them, Sana-chan.

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:08.010
- Are they gone?
- Yes.

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:09.550
Let's go see that impostor.

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:11.470
Wow, she recovered quickly.

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:20.520
- That is...
- That's me.

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:23.310
Kurata Sana, Kurata Sana...

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:45.340
Sana-chan, you want to go home, right?

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:48.300
Get in the car. Come on.

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:50.010
Ah, Sana-chan?

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:53.390
This is hard to take in.

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:57.470
Rei-kun, don't you think that
she went over the line?

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:58.560
Seems so.

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:02.560
That impostor tries to be me and
tries to act cuts.

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:03.480
You're right.

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:06.320
I'll make her pay.

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:08.940
Recently in movies it's very
popular to say this statement.{checar}

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:11.280
I'm going back to reason with that girl.

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:14.740
Good. But remember we do have a car.

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:23.250
Please move aside.

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:35.760
Who are you?

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:40.430
I'm Kurata Sana. 12 years old.

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:42.430
Even though I don't want to,
I'm turning 13 soon.

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:45.770
Impossible. I'm the real one.

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:49.610
Can you swirl around like this?

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:53.780
Haven't done that in a while.
Now I'm tired.

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:56.660
You are trying to use my name.
What kind of person are you?

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:59.330
Me... I was hired by someone.

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:01.290
I'm wearing a wig.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:02.750
Bald?

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:05.170
Shaved head...

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:07.420
...and you are trying to be me?!

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:09.340
Sana-chan, calm down.

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:11.670
I asked him to come.

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:13.630
We asked him to come.

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:16.180
But why?

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:19.640
He's our Kurata Sana-chan now.

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:22.430
But how?

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:27.980
We were the ones who sent false
information to the TV station.

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:32.610
We spread rumors and other things.

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:33.990
Why?

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:38.320
Sana-chan
has always been our idol.

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:39.870
This is not a bit exaggerated.

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:44.370
The Sana-chan we admire is
compassionate, courageous, energetic...

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:47.370
...a girl as bright as a sunflower.

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:52.250
But... last time we saw you working for a low budget video series...

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:56.840
We really didn't want to see you
like that.

00:17:57.220 --> 00:18:01.050
The Sana-chan is our hearts isn't
like that.

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:03.600
You're an impostor!

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:13.190
Come on, Sana-chan.

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:14.940
Do something!
Fight back.

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:16.240
You're so...

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:19.240
I understand now.

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:24.080
I understand you, Chitose-kun.

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:32.540
I understand the feelings all of you had toward the old Kurata Sana.

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:35.170
I'm leaving now.

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:37.630
Sorry, guys,
for interrupting your concert.

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:41.430
Bye, Bald Guy. I mean Sana-chan.

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:42.510
Do a good show.

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:44.310
Rei-kun, let's go home.

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:48.600
But lastly, Chitose-kun,
I want to say something.

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:52.650
I know you guys don't think much
of the Math Teacher video series.

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:54.610
Please go see it.

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:59.530
See it... you punk.

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:06.410
The new Sana-chan video...

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:10.000
- Math Teacher video series, please give me.
- It's amazing!

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:17.960
Everyone, do you all know about the Math Teacher video series? We highly recommend it.

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:20.010
It's so interesting and fun.

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:23.800
At a glance you will find that both characters are played by Sana-chan.

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:28.730
A lot of excitement.
Definitely worth checking out.

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:33.270
This is good, Sana-chan.

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:36.860
The real Sana-chan is very good.

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:41.780
You can't stop it here, Sana-chan.

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:44.870
Sana-chan, the video series is
getting rave reviews.

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:46.330
A lot of viewers sent letters and
faxes.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:49.450
These letters say they find the
videos entertaining.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:51.750
There's someone here to see you,
Mizoguchi-san.

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:53.670
Hi, Sana-chan.

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:55.000
Hello, Mizoguchi-san.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:57.210
Thanks for everything.

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:59.340
I heard that the videos
were really good.

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:02.550
Yes, videos for teaching math never sold that many copies before.

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:05.350
I brought a letter for Sana-chan.

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:09.470
It's from a fan, but sent to me.

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:11.520
Look at the sender's name.

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:15.230
Ah! It's Kurata Sana again.

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:17.110
What's wrong?

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:18.440
Let's look at the contents.

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:19.190
White dolphin.

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:24.490
I... I'm Kurata Sana. 9 years old.

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:29.370
Are you surpised?
We have the same name.

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:32.460
I've always been a fan of yours.

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:34.830
Oh... it's a regular letter.

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:38.130
It's really from a little girl
with the same name.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:40.710
After watching your Math Teacher
video series,

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:42.510
I was really happy and have...

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:45.010
started to like math a bit more.

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:50.720
Because of a disability I can't got
to school and I'm home-scholed.

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:54.440
Those videos really motivated me
to work harder.

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:56.730
I think they were great... help.

00:20:56.730 --> 00:21:00.940
I suppose school is really fun,
right?

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:02.610
Sana-chan, thank you...

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:05.570
...as a person with the same name
as you, I am very happy.

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:08.910
This kid says that she doesn't go
to school.

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:13.500
A lot of kids, due to disease and
disability, can't go to school.

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:18.420
When I was little I didn't go to
school due to disease.

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:20.670
Really... you?

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:22.760
No wonder you look sickly.

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:24.840
What kind of matters are those?

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:26.680
Even though I studied at home,

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:31.100
I really wanted to go to school
and study with everyone together.

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:36.020
So doing an educational video has
always been my dream.

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:40.860
This way, kids who can't go to school can watch and learn from videos at home.

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:42.820
So that's why.

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:47.780
After reading this letter I'm
cheered up, and have gained confidence.

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:54.910
Yeah, supporting each other is the
best way to help your fans.

00:21:55.710 --> 00:22:01.090
Yeah. I finally understand the feelings from Chitose-kun and the others.

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:05.260
Rei-kun, from now on I'm going to work.

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:07.090
Okay, good motivation.

00:22:07.090 --> 00:22:08.840
But right now you have no jobs.

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:11.930
There's a voice message for you.

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:13.470
This is...

00:22:14.640 --> 00:22:18.440
Sana-chan... help me.

00:22:21.230 --> 00:22:23.780
Another weird message asking
for help.

00:22:25.320 --> 00:22:27.650
Isn't that Zenjiro-san's voice?

00:22:27.650 --> 00:22:29.570
Oh? Yeah, you're right.

00:22:29.570 --> 00:22:32.740
Sana-chan... help me.

